        <div class="accordion-item__content" hidden="until-found">
          
                                    <p><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/aanmeldcentrum-ter-apel.jpg" width="400" height="225" alt="Ter Apel Application Centre" loading="lazy"></p><p><strong>Ter Apel application centre</strong></p><p>Ter Apelervenen 3<br>9561 MC Ter Apel</p><p>Always bring a valid proof of identity with you.</p><p><strong>Opening hours</strong></p><p>Monday to Friday: 08.00 - 18.00.</p><p><strong>Route description</strong></p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/IND+Kantoor+AC+Ter+Apel/@52.8859626,7.0327321,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x47b7c3cc00f7549b:0x42ecf1b8fdafa858!8m2!3d52.8859626!4d7.0349208">Plan your route to the Ter Apel application centre</a> by car or by public transport. Check the address including the postcode before you leave.</p><p><strong>Parking</strong></p><p>The application centre has its own free parking spaces.</p><p><a class="styled" href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/IND+Kantoor+AC+Ter+Apel/@52.8859626,7.0327321,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x47b7c3cc00f7549b:0x42ecf1b8fdafa858!8m2!3d52.8859626!4d7.0349208">Show Ter Apel application centre on map</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>
                              </div>
      </li>
                        <li class="accordion-item "
          >
        <a class="accordion-item__heading" role='button' tabindex='0'>
          <h3>2. Schiphol application centre</h3>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--open">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#open"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--close">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#minus"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <div class="accordion-item__content" hidden="until-found">
          
                                    <p>​<img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/aanmeldcentrum-schiphol.jpg" width="400" height="225" alt="Schiphol Application Centre" loading="lazy"></p><p><strong>Schiphol application centre (ACS)</strong></p><p>Duizendbladweg 100<br>1171 VA Badhoevedorp</p><p>Always bring a valid proof of identity with you.</p><p><strong>Opening hours</strong></p><p>Monday to Friday: 09.00 - 17.00.</p><p><strong>Route description</strong></p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/IND+Aanmeldcentrum+Schiphol/@52.3219844,4.7496563,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x0:0x72bcea410d55f2c3!8m2!3d52.3219844!4d4.751845">Plan your route to the Schiphol application centre</a> by car or by public transport. Check the address including the postcode before you leave.</p><p><strong>Parking</strong></p><p>Registered visitors of the application centre can park free of charge. Visitors who are not registered pay €2.50 per hour.</p><p>You can only pay with a debit card.</p><p><a class="styled" href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/IND+Aanmeldcentrum+Schiphol/@52.3219844,4.7496563,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x0:0x72bcea410d55f2c3!8m2!3d52.3219844!4d4.751845">Show Schiphol application centre on map</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>
                              </div>
      </li>
                        <li class="accordion-item "
          >
        <a class="accordion-item__heading" role='button' tabindex='0'>
