    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#minus"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <div class="accordion-item__content" hidden="until-found">
          
                                    <p><strong>​</strong><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/aanmeldcentrum-zevenaar.png" width="400" height="225" alt="Zevenaar Application Centre" loading="lazy"></p><p><strong>Zevenaar application centre</strong></p><p>Ringbaan Zuid 2a<br>6905 AB Zevenaar</p><p>Always bring a valid proof of identity with you.</p><p><strong>Opening hours</strong></p><p>Monday to Friday: 09.00 - 16.00.</p><p>You must make an appointment to visit the Zevenaar application centre.</p><p><strong>Route description</strong></p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Ringbaan+Zuid+2a,+6905+DB+Zevenaar/@51.9239077,6.0627064,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x47c79f615fbcf15b:0xd4d0b5a1129fab55!8m2!3d51.9239044!4d6.0648951">Plan your route to the Zevenaar application centre</a> by car or by public transport. Check the address including the postcode before you leave.</p><p><strong>Parking</strong></p><p>Registered visitors can park in the parking lot of the IND. Are you not registered? You can park in the parking lot at zalencentrum Staring. Do you have difficulties walking? Please contact the IND.</p><p><a class="styled" href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Ringbaan+Zuid+2a,+6905+DB+Zevenaar/@51.9239077,6.0627064,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x47c79f615fbcf15b:0xd4d0b5a1129fab55!8m2!3d51.9239044!4d6.0648951" title="Map application center Zevenaar">Show Zevenaar application center on map</a></p><p><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/Zevenaar%20engels.jpg" width="700" height="386" alt="Routekaart locatie Zevenaar" loading="lazy"></p><p>&nbsp;</p>
                              </div>
      </li>
                        <li class="accordion-item "
          >
        <a class="accordion-item__heading" role='button' tabindex='0'>
