<section class="pane--wysiwyg pane pane--default" data-pane-type="wysiwyg">
  <div class="container ">
    <div class="no-gutters row">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-8">
                                                      <div class="pane__content">
            <div class="pane--wysiwyg">
  <div class="pane__content">
    <div class="paragraph--wysiwyg">
      <h2><a class="ck-anchor" id="Expat-centres"></a>Expat Centres / IND Service Points</h2><p><span lang="EN-US" dir="ltr">Expat centres help highly skilled migrants on their arrival and with their residency in the Netherlands. For example, at an expat centre you can get a residence endorsement sticker, have your biometric data taken and collect your residence document. You must make an appointment to do this.</span><span> Each expat center can decide for itself whether and how much you have to pay (extra) for the service.</span></p><div class="notice-block"><span lang="EN-US" dir="ltr">Do you not want to pay for these services? Then choose an IND desk &nbsp;or IND Service Point on your residence permit application form to collect your residence permit. The IND offers these services free of charge.</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

        </div>
              </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

        
          
        
    

  


