        <div class="accordion-item__content" hidden="until-found">
          
                                    <p><span>&nbsp;</span><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/IN-Amsterdam.png" width="300" height="169" alt="In Amsterdam" loading="lazy"></p><p><strong>IN Amsterdam</strong></p><p>World Trade Center, Tower Two (ground floor)<br>Strawinskylaan 1767<br>1077 XX Amsterdam</p><p>Telephone: +31 (0)20 254 79 99<br>E-mail: <a href="mailto:welcome@amsterdam.nl">welcome@amsterdam.nl</a><br>Website: <a href="http://www.inamsterdam.com" target="_blank">www.inamsterdam.com</a></p><p>Always bring a valid proof of identity with you.</p><p><strong>Services of the IND</strong></p><ul><li>Taking biometrics</li><li>Issue of a residence document</li><li>Issue of a residence endorsement sticker</li></ul><p><strong>Route description</strong></p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Strawinskylaan+1767%2c+1077+XX+Amsterdam/%4052.3401166%2c4.8638862%2c15z/data=%213m1%214b1%214m5%213m4%211s0x47c60a049bbb157d:0x4146432ca37c7e75%218m2%213d52.3401169%214d4.872641">Plan your route to IN Amsterdam</a> by car or by public transport. Check the address including the postcode before you leave.</p><p><strong>Parking</strong></p><p>Paid parking is available in the area.</p><p><a class="styled" href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Strawinskylaan+1767%2c+1077+XX+Amsterdam/%4052.3401166%2c4.8638862%2c15z/data=%213m1%214b1%214m5%213m4%211s0x47c60a049bbb157d:0x4146432ca37c7e75%218m2%213d52.3401169%214d4.872641">Show IN Amsterdam on map</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>
                              </div>
      </li>
                        <li class="accordion-item "
          >
        <a class="accordion-item__heading" role='button' tabindex='0'>
