<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>The Hague International Centre</strong></p><p>​City Hall Den Haag (Atrium)<br>Spui 70<br>2511 BT Den Haag</p><p>Telephone: +31 (0)70 353 50 43<br><span>E-mail: </span><a href="mailto:internationalcentre@denhaag.nl"><span>internationalcentre@denhaag.nl</span></a><br><span>Website: </span><a href="https://www.thehagueinternationalcentre.nl/" target="_blank"><span>www.thehagueinternationalcentre.nl</span></a></p><p><span>Always bring a valid proof of identity with you.</span></p><p><span><strong>Services of the IND</strong></span></p><ul><li><span>Taking biometrics</span></li><li><span>Issue of a residence document</span></li><li><span>Issue of a residence endorsement sticker</span></li></ul><p><strong>Route description</strong></p><p><a href="https://www.google.nl/maps/place/Spui+70%2c+2511+BT+Den+Haag/%4052.0774296%2c4.3072996%2c15z/data=%213m1%214b1%214m5%213m4%211s0x47c5b723a4423019:0x4ac826c5d0a5d7d2%218m2%213d52.0774299%214d4.3160544">Plan your route to The Hague International Centre</a> by car or by public transport. Check the address including the postcode before you leave.</p><p><strong>Parking</strong></p><p>Paid parking is available in the area.</p><p><a class="styled" href="https://www.google.nl/maps/place/Spui+70%2c+2511+BT+Den+Haag/%4052.0774296%2c4.3072996%2c15z/data=%213m1%214b1%214m5%213m4%211s0x47c5b723a4423019:0x4ac826c5d0a5d7d2%218m2%213d52.0774299%214d4.3160544">Show The Hague International Centre on map</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>
