                                    <p><strong>IND Service Point Nijmegen</strong></p><p>Stadswinkel Nijmegen<br>Mariënburg 30<br>6511 PS Nijmegen<br><br>Always bring a valid proof of identity with you.</p><p><strong>Opening hours of the IND Service Point</strong></p><p><span>You can visit the IND Service Point by appointment only. For available time slots, please check our </span><a href="/en/service-contact/make-an-appointment-with-the-ind" title="Make an appointment with the IND" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="b51fdae2-1039-484b-8fb1-ca49c10cd603" data-entity-substitution="canonical">online appointment planner</a>.</p><p>The IND Service Point provides the following services and products:</p><ul><li>Taking biometrics</li><li>Issue of residence document</li><li>Issue of residence endorsement sticker or return visa</li></ul><p><strong>Route description</strong></p><p><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/s1qafjsj9uaL6UKD9" title="Plan your route to IND Service Point Goes">Plan your route to IND Service Point Nijmegen</a>&nbsp;by car or by public transport. Check the address including the postcode before you leave.</p><p><strong>Parking</strong></p><p>Paid parking is available in the area.</p><p><a class="styled" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/s1qafjsj9uaL6UKD9" title="Show IND Service Point Goes on map">Show IND Service Point Nijmegen on map</a></p>
                              </div>
      </li>
          </ul>
  </div>
</div>
    </div>
  </div>
        </div>
              </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

        
          
        
      

  


<section class="pane--wysiwyg pane pane--default" data-pane-type="wysiwyg">
  <div class="container ">
    <div class="no-gutters row">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-8">
                                                      <div class="pane__content">
            <div class="pane--wysiwyg">
  <div class="pane__content">
    <div class="paragraph--wysiwyg">
      <h2><a class="ck-anchor" id="Desks"></a>IND desks</h2><p>At the desks you can submit an application, get a residence endorsement sticker, collect your residence document or have biometric data taken, for example. Before you visit the desks, you first need to make an appointment&nbsp;<a href="/en/service-contact/make-an-appointment-with-the-ind" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="b51fdae2-1039-484b-8fb1-ca49c10cd603" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Make an appointment with the IND">online</a>. All IND desks are easily accessible by individuals in wheelchairs.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

        </div>
              </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

        
          
        
    

  


