                                    <p><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/IND-loket-Amsterdam.png" width="300" height="169" alt="IND Desk Amsterdam" loading="lazy"></p><p><strong>IND desk Amsterdam</strong></p><p>Pieter Calandlaan 1 (opposite the Lelylaan train station)<br>1065 KH&nbsp;Amsterdam</p><p><strong>Opening hours of the IND</strong></p><p>You can visit the IND desk by appointment only. For available time slots, please check our <a href="/en/service-contact/make-an-appointment-with-the-ind" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="b51fdae2-1039-484b-8fb1-ca49c10cd603" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Make an appointment with the IND">online appointment planner</a>.</p><p>This desk is accessible by individuals in wheelchairs.</p><p><strong>Route description</strong></p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/IND+Loketten+Amsterdam/%4052.3560553%2c4.8243688%2c15z/data=%213m1%214b1%214m5%213m4%211s0x47c5e387489bd9c3:0xd608e51ef8e82df7%218m2%213d52.3560556%214d4.8331236?hl=nl-NL">Plan your route to the IND desk Amsterdam</a>&nbsp;by car or by public transport. Check the address including the postcode before you leave.</p><p>Are u using <a href="https://maps.apple.com/place?address=Pieter%20Calandlaan%201,%201065%20KH%20Amsterdam,%20Nederland&amp;auid=5819702863121576069&amp;ll=52.356050,4.832863&amp;lsp=9902&amp;q=IND%20-%20Loket%20Amsterdam&amp;t=m">Apple maps</a>? Please enter the full address including the postcode: Pieter Calandlaan 1, 1065 KH. Otherwise, you will end up at the wrong location.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Parking</strong></p><p>Paid parking is available in the area.</p><p><a class="styled" href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/IND+Loketten+Amsterdam/%4052.3560553%2c4.8243688%2c15z/data=%213m1%214b1%214m5%213m4%211s0x47c5e387489bd9c3:0xd608e51ef8e82df7%218m2%213d52.3560556%214d4.8331236?hl=nl-NL">Show IND desk Amsterdam on map</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>
